      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 5.62,
          "en": "So let's dive into styling these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.62,
          "end": 8.39,
          "en": "And for that, we can go to the input component of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.39,
          "end": 10.56,
          "en": "and add this styles constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.56,
          "end": 12.69,
          "en": "where we use the React Native style sheet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.69,
          "end": 15.1,
          "en": "which is imported from React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.1,
          "end": 17.503,
          "en": "to set up our style definitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.85,
          "end": 22.26,
          "en": "Now, there are millions of ways of styling this, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.26,
          "end": 24.36,
          "en": "here's just one style suggestion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.36,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "which I will use in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 29.65,
          "en": "In there, I wanna style the View that wraps the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.65,
          "end": 32.223,
          "en": "So the label and the TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.223,
          "end": 35.64,
          "en": "and I also wanna style the label and the TextInput itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.64,
          "end": 36.98,
          "en": "Later in the module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.98,
          "end": 39.74,
          "en": "we will also add some error styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.74,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "to make it easier to show the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "if an incorrect value was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 46.923,
          "en": "But for the moment, we'll start with a base set of styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.8,
          "end": 52.23,
          "en": "So for this, I'll add my inputContainer style here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.23,
          "end": 54.91,
          "en": "which will be applied to that View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.91,
          "end": 57.923,
          "en": "And then also a label style object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.923,
          "end": 60.165,
          "en": "which is added to the text, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.165,
          "end": 62.387,
          "en": "and then the actual input style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.387,
          "end": 64.86,
          "en": "which is added to TextInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.86,
          "end": 67.14,
          "en": "Now, on the container, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.14,
          "end": 69.91,
          "en": "that we have some horizontal margin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.91,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "So to the left and right of four",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 74.419,
          "en": "and very important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.419,
          "end": 78.71000000000001,
          "en": "that we have some vertical margin of 16 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.71000000000001,
          "end": 81.27,
          "en": "Also to ensure that multiple inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 82.97,
          "en": "that are above each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.97,
          "end": 84.08,
          "en": "as we have it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.08,
          "end": 86.41,
          "en": "have some spacing between them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.41,
          "end": 88.743,
          "en": "That's why I add this vertical margin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 92.56,
          "en": "Now, we can fine tune these values later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.56,
          "end": 93.393,
          "en": "but for the start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.393,
          "end": 95.003,
          "en": "that is what I wanna start with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.22999999999999,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "Now, on the label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "I want to set the font size to 12,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 101.8,
          "en": "which is a bit smaller than the default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 101.8,
          "end": 103.63,
          "en": "that would be 14,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 103.63,
          "end": 106.7,
          "en": "but I wanna have a little bit of a smaller text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.7,
          "end": 111.063,
          "en": "And I will set the color here to GlobalStyles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.21000000000001,
          "end": 116.37,
          "en": "imported from my styles file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.37,
          "end": 118.00999999999999,
          "en": "in the constants folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.00999999999999,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "which we added in the previous core section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 124.46,
          "en": "So to GlobalStyles.colors.primary100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.43,
          "end": 129.94,
          "en": "I also wanna add a margin to the bottom here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.94,
          "end": 131.41,
          "en": "so that there is some spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 131.41,
          "end": 133.93,
          "en": "between the label and the TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.93,
          "end": 135.56,
          "en": "some vertical spacing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 135.56,
          "end": 139.653,
          "en": "and that margin to the bottom could be four pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.1,
          "end": 143.05,
          "en": "And then for the input itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.05,
          "end": 145.1,
          "en": "I wanna give it a background color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.1,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "so that the input is a bit easier to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 151.173,
          "en": "compared to the background we have on this screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.05,
          "end": 153.92000000000002,
          "en": "And I wanna give it a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.92000000000002,
          "end": 156.743,
          "en": "that is also taken from my GlobalStyles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.76,
          "end": 159.72,
          "en": "And there, I wanna dive into colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.72,
          "end": 162.09,
          "en": "and use primary100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.09,
          "end": 164.97,
          "en": "So the same color I'm using for the label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.97,
          "end": 167.42000000000002,
          "en": "Next, I also wanna add some padding here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.42000000000002,
          "end": 171.16,
          "en": "so that we have more spacing inside of the TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.16,
          "end": 174.21,
          "en": "more space around the text entered by the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 174.21,
          "end": 176.373,
          "en": "and there I'll use six pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.21,
          "end": 181.1,
          "en": "And also give this a border radius of six",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 181.1,
          "end": 182.74,
          "en": "to have some rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.74,
          "end": 184.193,
          "en": "on those input elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.17,
          "end": 187.72,
          "en": "I also want to add a font size of 18",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187.72,
          "end": 190.87,
          "en": "to make the text in the input elements bigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.87,
          "end": 195.583,
          "en": "so that it is easier to see and takes the focus of the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 200.42000000000002,
          "en": "Last but not least, I'll also add some text color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.42000000000002,
          "end": 203.49,
          "en": "So the color of the text that is being entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.49,
          "end": 206.18,
          "en": "by diving into colors of our GlobalStyles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 206.18,
          "end": 208.31,
          "en": "and using primary700,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.31,
          "end": 211.593,
          "en": "which is a dark shade of our primary purple color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.87,
          "end": 217.86,
          "en": "With that we have a start, a first set of styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.86,
          "end": 219.64,
          "en": "We can now apply them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.64,
          "end": 223.99,
          "en": "So now we can add this style here to this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.99,
          "end": 225.673,
          "en": "So the inputContainer style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.59,
          "end": 229.65,
          "en": "And then add a style here to this label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.65,
          "end": 232.57,
          "en": "and that of course would be the label style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.57,
          "end": 234.66,
          "en": "And then here on TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 236.39,
          "en": "we want to add a style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 236.39,
          "end": 240.773,
          "en": "that is our input style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 242.02,
          "end": 245.13,
          "en": "With all that set, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 245.13,
          "end": 246.313,
          "en": "that is what we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.37,
          "end": 250.67,
          "en": "Now, I think the spacing is a little bit too much",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 250.67,
          "end": 252.8,
          "en": "between these inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.8,
          "end": 255.28,
          "en": "so I will actually decrease",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 255.28,
          "end": 258.57,
          "en": "the marginVertical here to eight,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.57,
          "end": 260.27,
          "en": "so I halve it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.27,
          "end": 262.713,
          "en": "and by doing that, that looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 264.21,
          "end": 266.57,
          "en": "I also wanna ensure that this multiline input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 266.57,
          "end": 269.02,
          "en": "has multiple lines right from the start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 269.02,
          "end": 270.77,
          "en": "so that it's clear to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 270.77,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "that longer texts can be entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 275.4,
          "en": "So I wanna have some specific styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 275.4,
          "end": 276.983,
          "en": "for the multiline input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 278.24,
          "end": 279.65,
          "en": "Now to make this work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 279.65,
          "end": 281.43,
          "en": "I will make two changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 281.43,
          "end": 284.66700000000003,
          "en": "First, I will add the styling, inputMultiline,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 286.23,
          "end": 291.21,
          "en": "where we can simply give this a minHeight of 100 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 291.21,
          "end": 292.23,
          "en": "let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 292.23,
          "end": 293.75,
          "en": "to give this a minimum height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 293.75,
          "end": 296.653,
          "en": "which is applied even if nothing has been entered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 297.56,
          "end": 302.31,
          "en": "And I will also add textAlignVertical top here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 302.31,
          "end": 303.95,
          "en": "because that is a hint",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.95,
          "end": 306.62,
          "en": "that we actually get from the official docs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 306.62,
          "end": 308.433,
          "en": "If we have a look at multiline,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 309.3,
          "end": 313.11,
          "en": "there we learn that we should use textAlignVertical",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 313.11,
          "end": 317.09,
          "en": "set to top for the same behavior in both platforms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 317.09,
          "end": 320.07,
          "en": "So for the same look on both platforms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 320.07,
          "end": 323.293,
          "en": "That's why I'm adding textAlignVertical here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 324.471,
          "end": 326.63,
          "en": "But that's only step number one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 326.63,
          "end": 329.09,
          "en": "Now, we wanna apply this to the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 329.09,
          "end": 331.32,
          "en": "if it is multiline.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 331.32,
          "end": 333.14,
          "en": "Now to find out if it is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 333.14,
          "end": 336.59000000000003,
          "en": "we need to have a look at the text input configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 336.59000000000003,
          "end": 339.193,
          "en": "For that, I'll add a variable inputStyles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 340.38,
          "end": 341.82,
          "en": "which is an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 341.82,
          "end": 344.42,
          "en": "which has one element by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 344.42,
          "end": 346.58,
          "en": "And that would be our input styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 346.58,
          "end": 349.1,
          "en": "our standard input styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 349.1,
          "end": 351.831,
          "en": "And I wanna use inputStyles down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 351.831,
          "end": 352.8,
          "en": "for setting the styles on the TextInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 354.98,
          "end": 357.06,
          "en": "And I'm doing it like this now with a variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 357.06,
          "end": 361.53,
          "en": "so that we can then also dive into textInputConfig,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 361.53,
          "end": 363.65,
          "en": "and check if it's truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 363.65,
          "end": 365.05,
          "en": "And if it does exist,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 365.05,
          "end": 369.08,
          "en": "check if it has a multiline property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 369.08,
          "end": 370.83,
          "en": "which also is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 370.83,
          "end": 373.16,
          "en": "So, which is set to true for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 373.16,
          "end": 374.57,
          "en": "and if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 374.57,
          "end": 377.2,
          "en": "if we received a configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
